  <DialogueName>k__BackingField: Lacey2
  <Text>k__BackingField: You said he needs a new <style=item>thick rope</style> for
    the elevator? I could teach you how to make one, but it'll cost <style=coin>25
    coins</style> for the lesson and materials we'll use. Would that be okay with
    you?
  <LocalizedKey>k__BackingField: LOCAL_DIALOG_KEY
  <Choices>k__BackingField:
  - <Text>k__BackingField: Yes, teach me!
    LocalizeKey: LOCAL_CHOICE_KEY
    OutputID: 
    <NextDialogue>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 87d1c6476f599c34e90ea2a720f6f67f, type: 2}
  - <Text>k__BackingField: I can't afford that.
    LocalizeKey: LOCAL_CHOICE_KEY
    OutputID: 
    <NextDialogue>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 98c318a090643ca4ea1e693b2efdf864, type: 2}
  - <Text>k__BackingField: Not right now.
    LocalizeKey: LOCAL_CHOICE_KEY
    OutputID: 
    <NextDialogue>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 14eb3d2a7f8d06c4c8eee468ab261d66, type: 2}
